sequenceDiagram
  participant S as 学生
  participant JD as job_detail页面
  participant AJ as applyJob
  participant MA as manage_applications页面
  participant UAS as updateApplicationStatus
  participant GJD as getJobDetail
  participant DB as 云数据库

  S->>JD: 点击申请职位
  JD->>AJ: callFunction({ jobId })
  AJ->>DB: 写入applications(status=pending)
  AJ-->>JD: 申请成功

  MA->>UAS: 更新状态为processing/accepted
  UAS->>DB: 校验并更新状态
  UAS-->>MA: 状态更新成功

  S->>JD: 重新打开职位详情
  JD->>GJD: callFunction({ id })
  GJD->>DB: 查询申请状态
  GJD-->>JD: accepted返回敏感字段

